00:08:23.169 --> 00:08:29.011
But it's Kyiv and Kiev,
is the Ukrainian transliteration.

00:08:29.580 --> 00:08:32.478
Kiev is the Russian transliterization.

00:08:32.765 --> 00:08:35.901
And most you you have heard
Kiev from the outside.

00:08:36.501 --> 00:08:39.267
Better to say Kyiv when you're here

00:08:39.267 --> 00:08:42.352
